        ]
      },
      "statement": "UActorComponent registration (OnRegister/OnUnregister) is separate from initialization (InitializeComponent/UninitializeComponent) and from play (BeginPlay/EndPlay). TickComponent is the component tick override; Tick is an actor hook.",
